  "body": "This changes the document-conformance requirements for the `link` element\r\nsuch that it’s conforming for it to have a `color` attribute if it has\r\n`rel=mask-icon` (instead of `rel=icon`). But this doesn’t change any\r\nUA requirements; instead it includes a note that (unlike for `rel=icon`),\r\nUAs are not actually required to do anything for `rel=mask-icon`.\r\n\r\nFixes https://github.com/validator/validator/issues/174\r\n\r\nThis is my first PR on this project, so apologies if I missed any required steps.\r\n\r\n/CC @sideshowbarker ",
